  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah ! Quel timing ! Toi, là, tu m’as l’air d’un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe\nDresseu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȁrse expérimenté<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On se défend plutôt pas mal, nous aussi. On a une\nstratégie en béton, et on n’arrête pas de gagner !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le secret de notre force ? Les capacités de statut !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500200073006500630072006500740020006400650020006E006F00740072006500200066006F0072006300650020003F0020004C006500730020006300610070006100630069007400E9007300200064006500200073007400610074007500740020002100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les capacités de statut permettent de rendre\nles Pokémon plus forts !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500730020006300610070006100630069007400E9007300200064006500200073007400610074007500740020007000650072006D0065007400740065006E0074002000640065002000720065006E006400720065000A006C0065007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200070006C0075007300200066006F0072007400730020002100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ou d’affaiblir les Pokémon ennemis !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0075002000642019006100660066006100690062006C006900720020006C0065007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200065006E006E0065006D006900730020002100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un combat, ça ne se résume pas aux dégâts\ninfligés, comme tu vas vite t’en rendre compte !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu vas adorer, je te le garantis !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400750020007600610073002000610064006F007200650072002C0020006A00650020007400650020006C006500200067006100720061006E0074006900730020002100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quelle inconscience... je veux dire, quel courage\nde défier nos capacités de statut !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nous sommes partants pour te donner une leçon\ndès que tu seras prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "À vos marques... Prêts...\nAh non, c’est un combat, pas une course.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C000200076006F00730020006D006100720071007500650073002E002E002E00200050007200EA00740073002E002E002E000A004100680020006E006F006E002C00200063201900650073007400200075006E00200063006F006D006200610074002C002000700061007300200075006E006500200063006F0075007200730065002E00100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Partez !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007200740065007A002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Euh, je dois m’échauffer d’abord...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500750068002C0020006A006500200064006F006900730020006D201900E90063006800610075006600660065007200200064201900610062006F00720064002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Avec les capacités de statut, c’est comme une\ncourse de fond : ça commence lentement.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nOn a l’habitude d’attendre !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mes capacités de statut préférées sont celles\nqui augmentent les stats de mon Pokémon !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Plus le combat s’éternisera, moins tes Pokémon\nauront de chances de l’emporter !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Plus rien ne nous arrête ! On va battre notre\nrecord de victoires consécutives !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nooon !!! Notre série de victoires a été\ninterrompue !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F006F006F006E00200021002100210020004E006F0074007200650020007300E900720069006500200064006500200076006900630074006F006900720065007300200061002000E9007400E9000A0069006E0074006500720072006F006D0070007500650020002100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas encore ! On est un duo, il suffit que je gagne !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007300200065006E0063006F00720065002000210020004F006E002000650073007400200075006E002000640075006F002C00200069006C002000730075006600660069007400200071007500650020006A00650020006700610067006E00650020002100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "À mon tour ! Je ne te laisserai pas te mettre\nen travers de notre record !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si je gagne, on battra notre record de victoires\nconsécutives. Alors dépêche-toi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En garde !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E002000670061007200640065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un instant, s’il vous plaît.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E00200069006E007300740061006E0074002C0020007320190069006C00200076006F0075007300200070006C006100EE0074002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu as peur de ce que je vais faire aux stats\nde tes pauvres Pokémon, c’est ça ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mes capacités de statut préférées sont celles\nqui baissent les stats de l’adversaire !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sous leur effet, tu ne seras pas en mesure\nd’utiliser ta stratégie habituelle !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On forme un duo de choc ! Et on ne s’avouera\nvaincus que si tu nous bats tous les deux !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nos capacités de statut n’ont pas suffi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00730020006300610070006100630069007400E9007300200064006500200073007400610074007500740020006E2019006F006E007400200070006100730020007300750066006600690020002100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai eu beau renforcer mes Pokémon...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A20190061006900200065007500200062006500610075002000720065006E0066006F00720063006500720020006D0065007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002E002E002E00100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... et moi affaiblir les tiens...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E0020006500740020006D006F00690020006100660066006100690062006C006900720020006C006500730020007400690065006E0073002E002E002E00100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... rien n’y a fait !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E0020007200690065006E0020006E2019007900200061002000660061006900740020002100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dis-nous, s’il te plaît ! Quelle est la chose la plus\nimportante pour gagner ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Avoir confiance en ses Pokémon.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410076006F0069007200200063006F006E006600690061006E0063006500200065006E002000730065007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bien entraîner ses Pokémon.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200690065006E00200065006E00740072006100EE006E00650072002000730065007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hum... Oui, bien sûr, c’est évident...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480075006D002E002E002E0020004F00750069002C0020006200690065006E0020007300FB0072002C002000632019006500730074002000E90076006900640065006E0074002E002E002E00100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Renforcer ou affaiblir des stats, ça n’est pas\nsuffisant pour gagner à tous les coups...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 4876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci pour cette leçon. Décidément, les combats\nde Pokémon, c’est compliqué !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je suis contente de t’avoir affronté<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020007300750069007300200063006F006E00740065006E0074006500200064006500200074201900610076006F0069007200200061006600660072006F006E007400E900100003110000FF010000650020002100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci pour cette leçon. Décidément, les combats\nde Pokémon, c’est compliqué !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je suis contente de t’avoir affronté<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 5504,
